#VRML_SIM R2025a utf8

# ============================================================
#  Pioneer 3-AT — laberinto serpiente (arena cuadrada 24×24 m)
#  Muro dcho: WALL_RIGHT_INNER + pasillo 1 m + WALL_RIGHT_OUTER.
